DROP SCHEMA tm2 CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 9 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to table tm2.t
drop cascades to type tm2.mood
drop cascades to type tm2.pair
drop cascades to type tm2.pos
drop cascades to type tm2.wrap
drop cascades to type tm2.calm
drop cascades to function tm2.f(tm2.mood)
drop cascades to materialized view tm2.mv1
drop cascades to materialized view tm2.mv2
